function badge(v){let c=v==='REGULARIZADO'?'ok':v==='CONTINUA PENDENTE'?'nok':v==='PENDENTE REALIZAÇÃO'?'wait':v==='SIM'?'yes':'';return `<span class="badge ${c}">${v}</span>`}
function esc(s){return String(s??'').replace(/[&<>"']/g,m=>({'&':'&amp;','<':'&lt;','>':'&gt;','"':'&quot;',"'":'&#39;'}[m]))}
function renderKPIs(){let a=DATA.summary;kTotal.textContent=a.length;kOk.textContent=a.filter(x=>x.situacao==='REGULARIZADO').length;kNok.textContent=a.filter(x=>x.situacao==='CONTINUA PENDENTE').length;kWait.textContent=a.filter(x=>x.blitz_mes==='PENDENTE REALIZAÇÃO').length;kRec.textContent=a.filter(x=>x.recorrente==='SIM').length}
function filtered(){let q=search.value.toLowerCase(),m=modalFilter.value,s=statusFilter.value;return DATA.summary.filter(x=>(!q||(`${x.colaborador} ${x.matricula} ${x.placa}`).toLowerCase().includes(q))&&(!m||x.modal===m)&&(!s||x.situacao===s||x.blitz_mes===s))}
